<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GreenPoint cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GreenPoint cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter said it downgraded GreenPoint Financial Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-3/16 to 64-3/8.</p>
